Changes in v3:
 -I looked into Sashiko's concerns about not checking if if_info->orig_x referenced if_info->a.
  Even though I didn't find a testcase that can reproduce the error, I still added the condition
  checking it from my reading of noce_process_if_block, as a defensive check.
 -Added the check if_info->else_bb so as to not reject the blocks with no else arm. (I did not find 
  an input that reaches this case, the no-else shapes I tried are converted earlier 
  by noce_convert_multiple_sets.)
**I am posting this v3 because I failed to address all the concerns of Sashiko as Jeff suggested on v1's thread
(as new concerns popped up on v2 from sashiko, because I changed the position of the patch on v2 to make
the change less destructive when it didn't have a clear optimization path). Is this okay now?

